    "title": "Small Business Loan Track Preparation",
    "content": "Parallel research and synthesis plan to create a comprehensive small business loan initiation package. Three workstreams run in parallel initially: (1) deep product analysis comparing SBA 7(a), microloans, CDFIs, and local bank/credit union options, (2) building a specific lender shortlist with current 2026 requirements and contact details, and (3) developing the DSCR calculation framework. Once products and lenders are defined, the application checklist/timeline is assembled. Finally, all components are synthesized into actionable recommendations.",
